  "description": "This texture pack features classic striped ticking fabric in warm tan and cream tones, perfect for farmhouse-style decor, fabric printing, sublimation, and upholstery projects. Delivered as an instant digital download for commercial use.\nWhat’ Included:\n• High-resolution seamless texture files\n• 12″ × 12″ (3600 × 3600 pixels)\n• Seamless repeating pattern for easy tiling\n• Ready for print, digital, and texture-mapping workflows\n• Suitable for use in most graphic design and 3D software\nPerfect For:\n• Rug & Carpet Product Mockups\n• Interior Design & Room Visualization\n• Flooring & Home Decor\n• Furniture & Upholstery Projects\n• 3D Rendering & Game Environments\n• Fabric & Textile Design\n• Wallpaper & Surface Design\n• Digital Backgrounds\n• Print-on-Demand Products\n• Creative Mockups\nThese textures are easy to tile, scale, and incorporate into graphic design, 3D visualization, mockups, and creative workflows. Use them to add realistic surface detail, depth, and a professional finish to your projects. Thank you!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>This texture pack features classic striped ticking fabric in warm tan and cream tones, perfect for farmhouse-style decor, fabric printing, sublimation, and upholstery projects. Delivered as an instant digital download for commercial use.</p>\n<p>What’ Included:<br>\n• High-resolution seamless texture files<br>\n• 12″ × 12″ (3600 × 3600 pixels)<br>\n• Seamless repeating pattern for easy tiling<br>\n• Ready for print, digital, and texture-mapping workflows<br>\n• Suitable for use in most graphic design and 3D software</p>\n<p>Perfect For:<br>\n• Rug &amp; Carpet Product Mockups<br>\n• Interior Design &amp; Room Visualization<br>\n• Flooring &amp; Home Decor<br>\n• Furniture &amp; Upholstery Projects<br>\n• 3D Rendering &amp; Game Environments<br>\n• Fabric &amp; Textile Design<br>\n• Wallpaper &amp; Surface Design<br>\n• Digital Backgrounds<br>\n• Print-on-Demand Products<br>\n• Creative Mockups</p>\n<p>These textures are easy to tile, scale, and incorporate into graphic design, 3D visualization, mockups, and creative workflows. Use them to add realistic surface detail, depth, and a professional finish to your projects. Thank you!</p>",
